      "value": "I have not managed to reproduce this error, having unity 2018 and susbtance in unity, the scenes that I upload with substances are uploaded correctly, although the substance is generated when I upload the map, not in the level load (although generating the textures when loading the level has always given problems(it may be related to this(attached image)))(if you mean to load a world made with unity 2017, if I get that error, but it is solved by updating it)\ntest worlds that I used to test: \n\n2017: wrld_9f1bc0ee-3c66-407a-837f-37889eb08633\n\n2018: wrld_f3e891df-4d81-41d4-bdc6-b7bd90cc0cbe",
