      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not a bug, Unity removed Substance Painter procedural materials support, so the material won't generate the textures need on load anymore. There's a plugin in the asset store that imports substance materials and bakes the textures for use that should fix those materials but make the project bigger since it doesn't generate textures on the fly in the client but during build.\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/utilities/substance-in-unity-110555",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
